#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166787 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166625 :question/id #uuid "1c7e6096-bb20-53a3-a605-42b72948fe98" :question/math-academy-id "e-8408" :question/problem "Calculate\n$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits} \\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{x\\sinh{x^2}}{\\cosh{x^2}}\\, \\textrm{d}x$." :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nLet\n\n$$\nu= \\cosh{x^2}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}u}{\\textrm{d}x} = 2x\\sinh{x^2} \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\dfrac{1}{2} \\, \\textrm{d}u = x\\sinh{x^2} \\,\\textrm{d}x\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} \\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits} \\displaystyle \\int \\dfrac{x\\sinh{x^2}}{\\cosh{x^2}}\\, \\textrm{d}x &= \\int \\dfrac{1}{\\cosh{x^2}}\\cdot x\\sinh{x^2}\\, \\textrm{d}x \\\\[5pt] &= \\int \\dfrac{1}{u}\\cdot \\dfrac{1}{2} \\, \\textrm d u \\\\[5pt] &= \\dfrac{1}{2}\\int \\dfrac{1}{u}\\, \\textrm{d}u \\\\[5pt] &= \\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid u \\mid +C \\\\[5pt] &= \\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln\\left(\\cosh{x^2}\\right)+ C \\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "c95abaf8-c2ed-500b-a9d4-20c3346367b7" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050543 :topic/math-academy-id 3251 :topic/title "Differentiating Reciprocal Hyperbolic Functions"}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186482796 :question-generator/id #uuid "524f71ee-d847-5082-9416-3d405725646e" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186166787.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167387 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aff36429-0b6f-5b08-8cb1-f9d62a0594fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 3\\coth x - 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165531} {:answer/id #uuid "e3a926a7-ebcb-55be-a1d2-c2ae0b0d7c8d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\ln \\mid 3csch x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165532} {:answer/id #uuid "e582cf2c-3005-590e-822f-6f81d5d7084e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\ln \\mid 3\\coth x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165533} {:answer/id #uuid "2841714b-58f6-5b44-afa8-6918901949b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 3csch^{2} x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165534} {:answer/id #uuid "4e9007e0-94ad-5510-8a51-eb0257525d66" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\ln \\mid c