/id #edb/ref 17592186482788}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3ef1fcaa-1646-5614-873d-25a0df23f7f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 2\\coth x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482743} :answer-field/id #uuid "07f85100-8712-59cf-a27d-56dd1e288072" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482727}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9d7703e8-d1c3-5dcd-a034-b13a6e5e635d" :question/problem "What is $\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\displaystyle \\int\\frac{\\csch^{2} x}{2\\coth x + 1}dx$?" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nLet $u=2\\coth x+1$. Differentiating gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2\\csch^2 x,\n\\qquad \\csch^2 x\\,\\mathrm{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.$$\n\nUsing this substitution, we obtain\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\int\\frac{\\csch^2 x}{2\\coth x+1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n&=-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|u|+C \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|2\\coth x+1|+C.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe antiderivative is valid on each interval where $x\\ne0$ and $2\\coth x+1\\ne0$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186482774 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e559296-77e3-5ce6-9097-3e91f43b48e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}\\ln \\mid 4\\coth x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482730} {:answer/id #uuid "7c803a1f-d083-58cf-88a0-a1b2ac3de33f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\ln \\mid 4\\csch^{2} x + 1 \\mid + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482763} {:answer/id #uuid "812dc02b-7e05-5eb3-9f95-062b2764166f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\ln \\mid